# Minivo — Project Rules for Cascade

## Project Overview
- **App Name:** Minivo
- **Developer:** Puzzlora Games
- **Package:** com.puzzloragames.dropzy
- **Dart package name:** minivo
- **Path:** /Users/kalpesh.panchbhai/Developer/Personal/minivo
- **Description:** Mobile game aggregator with 100+ mini games — puzzles, arcade, board & more.

## Tech Stack
- Flutter (latest stable)
- Flame engine for game rendering
- GoRouter for navigation
- SharedPreferences for local storage
- Google Fonts (Poppins) for typography
- flutter_animate for animations

## Architecture
- Feature-based folder structure under lib/features/
- Games under lib/games/ with one folder per game
- Core utilities under lib/core/ (constants, models, services, widgets)
- Routing under lib/routing/

## Key Patterns
- **GameRegistry** (lib/games/game_registry.dart): Central registry mapping game IDs to widget builders and game metadata. Every new game MUST be registered here.
- **GameWrapper** (lib/games/game_wrapper.dart): Universal game lifecycle wrapper providing HUD, pause overlay, game over overlay, score tracking, star rating, and coin economy. Every game screen MUST be wrapped in GameWrapper.
- **ScoreService** (lib/core/services/score_service.dart): Singleton service using SharedPreferences for persisting high scores, favorites, settings, recently played, coins, and games played.
- **AudioService** (lib/core/services/audio_service.dart): Singleton for haptic feedback and sound effects.

